{"title":"无题","authors":[],"dates":[{"year":1977,"month":8,"day":22}],"is_range_date":false,"parts":[{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"英明领袖华国锋主席，党中央副主席叶剑英、邓小平、李先念、汪东兴和中央政治局其他领导同志，八月二十日会见了出席中国共产党第十一次全国代表大会的代表。"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新华社记者摄(传真照片)"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"韦国清、许世友、耿飚同志"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乌兰夫、方毅同志"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"刘伯承同志"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"纪登奎同志"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苏振华、赛福鼎同志"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"李德生同志"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"照片均为新华社记者摄"}],"comments":[],"origin":"新华社","comment_pivots":[],"description":"","page_start":1,"page_end":1,"alias":""}